          "formula": "\\|G(s,z)\\|\\le\\sqrt{\\eta_s}\\|z\\|+\\|G(s,0)\\|,\\quad G(s,\\cdot)\\in L^1(\\gamma;E),\\quad\\mathrm{id}\\in L^1(K_s;E).",
